            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A **short text badge** instead of a number (.badge(\"NEW\")), for status notices."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "数字の代わりに**短いテキストのバッジ**（.badge(\"NEW\")）。状態を知らせる通知。"
